# Secrets: every .env variant, however it is suffixed.
# `.env` under "Virtual environments" above matches only that exact name, so
# backups like `.env.bak-phase0` or `.env.local-backup-20260910` slipped past
# it while holding live SECRET_KEY / CREDENTIAL_ENCRYPTION_KEY values.
# `.env.example` is the one that must stay tracked.
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.env.*
!.env.example
!*.env.example
# Tracked on purpose: shipped, secret-free defaults that let a fresh
# clone boot with no configuration at all. `*.env` above would
# otherwise ignore it.
!infra/local/defaults.env
